==Old English==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ang|ǵews}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*keusaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*ǵews-||taste, choose}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|kiāsa}} ({{cog|fy|kieze}}), {{cog|osx|kiosan}} ({{cog|nds|kesen}}), {{cog|nl|kiezen}}, {{cog|goh|kiosan}}, {{m|goh|chiosan}} ({{cog|de|kiesen}}), {{cog|non|kjósa}} ({{cog|da|kyse}}, {{cog|is|kjósa}}), {{cog|got|𐌺𐌹𐌿𐍃𐌰𐌽}}. The Indo-European root was also the source of {{cog|la|gustus||taste}}, {{cog|sq|desha||chosen}}.

